    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Follow us</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003460/extras/5f97ff53be9125da7f857105a8cbbb50.avif?t=1754624411\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>&gt;&gt; Twitter: Bang Bang Barrage<br>&gt;&gt; Tiktok: bangbangbarrage</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003460/extras/db79009eb59603c141a4402a781bc11c.avif?t=1754624411\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br><strong>Recoil-Driven Navigation:</strong> Propel yourself through the waters with each shot! Turn gunplay into a dance of strategy and precision. Master the art of movement to outmaneuver and outlast the sea\u2019s dangers.<br><br><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem: </strong>Sail solo or with up to three friends, mastering the waves through seamless teamwork or solo cunning. More players, more chaos!<br><br><strong>Endless Replayability: </strong>Each voyage across the sea is unique, with fresh challenges, traits, and upgrade paths to explore. No two games are the same, ensuring endless fun and discovery.<br><br><strong>Ever-Changing Voyages: </strong>Tailor each run with a variety of upgrades and adapt to spontaneous buffs and debuffs that the sea throws at you. Adapt your strategy on the fly and make the most out of unexpected twists and turns.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003460/extras/43b506ba08070e213c95d9a0ee3013b2.poster.avif?t=1754624411\" width=174 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003460/extras/43b506ba08070e213c95d9a0ee3013b2.webm?t=1754624411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003460/extras/43b506ba08070e213c95d9a0ee3013b2.mp4?t=1754624411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003460/extras/db79009eb59603c141a4402a781bc11c.avif?t=1754624411\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br><strong>Recoil-Driven Navigation:</strong> Propel yourself through the waters with each shot! Turn gunplay into a dance of strategy and precision. Master the art of movement to outmaneuver and outlast the sea\u2019s dangers.<br><br><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem: </strong>Sail solo or with up to three friends, mastering the waves through seamless teamwork or solo cunning. More players, more chaos!<br><br><strong>Endless Replayability: </strong>Each voyage across the sea is unique, with fresh challenges, traits, and upgrade paths to explore. No two games are the same, ensuring endless fun and discovery.<br><br><strong>Ever-Changing Voyages: </strong>Tailor each run with a variety of upgrades and adapt to spontaneous buffs and debuffs that the sea throws at you. Adapt your strategy on the fly and make the most out of unexpected twists and turns.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003460/extras/43b506ba08070e213c95d9a0ee3013b2.poster.avif?t=1754624411\" width=174 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003460/extras/43b506ba08070e213c95d9a0ee3013b2.webm?t=1754624411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003460/extras/43b506ba08070e213c95d9a0ee3013b2.mp4?t=1754624411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "Survive the treacherous sea in this quirky multiplayer shooter game! Play solo or team up and fight off Cthulhu's minions. Master a unique recoil-based mechanic to blast enemies and chart your course. Mix and match upgrades to craft the perfect sea-surviving strategy!",
